next aurum-druid/wetlands-prerequisites

step Begin at Sentinel Hill
  tip Our Moonbrook chapter leads here after the early Defias and Alba prerequisites. Completed quests should check off; accepted dungeon quests stay in your quest log. Continue the remaining prerequisites before entering with your group. This route stays in the Aurum pack.
  level 18

