step Stormwind: dungeon pickups and engineers
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Fly to Stormwind. Wilder Thistlenettle is in the Dwarven District inn; Shoni and Sprite are in the same district. Collect these quests now so the party does not need to leave the mines later.
  fly "Stormwind"
