step Sentinel Hill and the messenger
  tip The Defias Messenger patrols the roads between Moonbrook, the Gold Coast Quarry and Jangolode Mine. Follow those roads and look for him; the arrow marks a search starting point, not his live position. Kill him, loot A Mysterious Message, then return to Gryan Stoutmantle at Sentinel Hill.
  zone Westfall
  fly "Sentinel Hill"
  turnin 141
  accept 142
  turnin 92752 optional
  accept 92753 group 5 optional
  collect 1381 npc 550 x1 quest 142.1 -- Kill the Defias Messenger and loot A Mysterious Message.
  turnin 142

step Escort the Defias Traitor
  tip Keep the escort alive until the quest completes, then return to Sentinel Hill for the actual VanCleef quest and Red Silk Bandanas.
  accept 155
  complete 155
  turnin 155
  accept 166 lvl 14 group 5
  accept 214 lvl 14 group 5

step Enter the Deadmines with your party
  tip Repair at Sentinel Hill and refill roughly 10-20 level-appropriate drinks within your budget, then follow the road south-west to Moonbrook with the group. Enter the mine through the large building at the hideout marker and descend its tunnels. Before the instance portal, take the undead side tunnels for Wilder's two quests. Return to the main mine passage afterward and enter the instance together.
  vendor nearest
  goto 42.5,71.7 "Deadmines hideout" live r 25

step Clear the mine and the dungeon
  tip Finish the undead side-area objectives, loot the machinery and bandanas, and kill VanCleef. If you chose Alba's optional explosives chain, use her Extra-Destructive Explosives at the forge as your quest log directs. Loot VanCleef's letter and right-click it to start the Stockade follow-up.
  complete 167 group 5
  complete 168 group 5
  complete 2040 group 5
  complete 214 group 5
  complete 166 group 5
  note Only if you accepted the optional explosives quest: place the Extra-Destructive Explosives at the forge when it directs you. The event has no numbered counter in the reference data; confirm its completion before leaving.
  accept 373 item 2874 lvl 16 -- Loot VanCleef's Unsent Letter and right-click it. This starts the later Stockades and Seal of Wrynn chain.

step Optional: Alba at the exit
  tip Meet Alba outside the exit and finish the detonator follow-up. Check the quest log for its event before turning it in.
  turnin 92753 optional
  accept 92819 optional
  turnin 92819 optional -- First use the detonator and wait for its event, then speak to Alba when the hand-in becomes available.

step Lighthouse after leaving Deadmines
  tip From the Deadmines coastal exit, follow the shore west to the Westfall Lighthouse. Captain Graysons three outdoor tasks provide explicit XP before Cat Form. Five Flasks of Oil are needed for his supply quest. Any already in your bags count; collect only the shortfall from ordinary Harvest Watchers now, at this later level. The early level-12 circuit does not require harvester farming.
  accept 103 lvl 10
  accept 152 lvl 10
  accept 104 lvl 15

step The Westfall coast
  tip Work north along the shore for all four murloc varieties. Old Murk-Eye patrols the southern coast; he is level 20, so fight him here after the dungeon rather than during the early Westfall visit. Clear nearby murlocs and pull him alone.
  kill 126 quest 152.1
  kill 171 quest 152.2
  kill 127 quest 152.3
  kill 517 quest 152.4
  collect 3636 npc 391 quest 104.1
  collect 814 npc 114 x5 quest 103.1 -- Saved oil counts from your bags; only farm the shortfall if needed.

step Lighthouse rewards before leaving Westfall
  tip Return to Captain Grayson and finish all three quests, then use the roads to Sentinel Hill for the dungeon rewards. This chapter does not ask you to repeat the dungeon merely to reach 20.
  turnin 103
  turnin 152
  turnin 104

step Sentinel Hill rewards
  tip Follow the coast and roads back from the mine exit to Sentinel Hill. Turn in the VanCleef and bandana quests before flying to Stormwind.
  turnin 166
  turnin 214

