  turnin 389 -- Warden Thelwater is outside the Stockades; the actual prison run is planned at 22.

step Next: Cat Form and the Menethil stop
  tip The outdoor lighthouse circuit and dungeon hand-ins should bring this pass close to 20. If actual party XP or drop luck leaves a small gap, finish level-appropriate Defias on the Westfall return until the bar reaches 20; do not assume a fixed dungeon-repeat count. Then continue to Cat Form. The harder Greenwarden combat is scheduled in our later Wetlands chapter.
  level 20
